{"id": "t025-002", "text": "Long catch up with Meera after book club. Her sister Divya had the baby on Sunday morning, a little girl, 7lb 2oz, no name announced yet. Labour was long and Divya's still exhausted, her husband's mum has moved in for a fortnight to help. Christening is pencilled in for 6 December 2026. Meera's going to be godmother and is already panicking about the speech, she hates public speaking. Also, Meera's got her own interview at Aviva on the 3rd at 2pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christening", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 December 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "godmother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates public speaking", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at Aviva", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd at 2pm", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t025-004", "text": "Varun didn't get the Deloitte job. Gutted, he really thought the final round went well. He's applying for two more this week. Remind me to message him Friday to see how he's holding up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Deloitte job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for two more", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t025-005", "text": "Spoke to Adaeze on the phone. Baby shower's off, her mum isn't well enough to travel so they've called it off. Doing a small family lunch instead on the 14th at 1. She sounded tired.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well enough to travel", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small family lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at 1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t025-008", "text": "Freya rang. Her interview at the hospital went really well, they're letting her know by Wednesday afternoon. Her dog Biscuit is having his teeth done on Monday too so she's all over the place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the hospital", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday afternoon"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having his teeth done", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "all over the place", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t025-009", "text": "Bumped into Mandla at the shop. His brother Thabo just moved back from Joburg and is job hunting, mostly logistics roles. Mandla asked if I knew anyone. I should ask Claire if her place is hiring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back from Joburg", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "job hunting, mostly logistics roles", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Claire if her place is hiring", "owner": "p4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t025-013", "text": "Chloe's struggling. Six applications, no callbacks, and her contract at the museum ends 31 December 2026. She's had a rough few months generally, her and her partner split in the summer and she's back at her dad's. She's thinking of retraining as a teacher, maybe primary. Remind me to send her that link about PGCE open evenings, the next one's Tuesday 10 November at 6pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "contract at the museum ends", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "had a rough few months", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at her dad's", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of retraining as a teacher, maybe primary", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that link about PGCE open evenings", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PGCE open evenings", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday 10 November at 6pm", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t025-015", "text": "Sunil got the job!! Senior analyst at the NHS trust, starts 4 January 2027. Hadiza says he's been grinning for two days. They're having a few people round on Saturday to celebrate, I'm invited. Must get him a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Senior analyst at the NHS trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having a few people round", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t025-018", "text": "Elijah's got an interview at Google next Tuesday at 2. Fourth round, the system design one, and if it goes well there's a final chat with the hiring manager the week after. Says he isn't nervous but he definitely is, he kept changing the subject. His partner Aaliyah is cooking him a big dinner after whatever happens. Text him good luck Monday night, and call him Wednesday to find out how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at Google", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final chat with the hiring manager", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after whatever happens", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t025-019", "text": "Jada had her 20 week scan yesterday, all fine. They're not finding out the gender. She's craving pickles constantly and can't stand the smell of coffee anymore. Due date is 9 February 2027.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "20 week scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not finding out the gender", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "craving pickles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand the smell of coffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due date", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 February 2027", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t025-021", "text": "Caught up with Anders after five a side. His wife Freya's pregnant, about 12 weeks, they're telling family at Christmas so keep it quiet. Morning sickness has been brutal for her. He's also interviewing for a team lead role internally on 3 November at 9am, up against two people from the Manchester office. Wants to quit if he doesn't get it, he's been passed over twice already. Their cat Miso knocked over the Christmas decorations box while I was there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interviewing for a team lead role internally", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 November at 9am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants to quit if he doesn't get it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "passed over twice", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Miso", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t025-024", "text": "Divya and her husband are christening the baby on 6 December at half 10, St Mary's. Reception after at the cricket club. Must RSVP by 20 November. Need to find a christening gift, Meera says a silver bracelet with her initials.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 December at half 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Reception", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "RSVP", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 20 November", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find a christening gift", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "silver bracelet with her initials", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t025-027", "text": "Simone mentioned she's thinking about going back to work part time after the baby, maybe from September 2027. She used to do HR at Unilever. Wants something local.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work part time", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the baby", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe from September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "used to do HR at Unilever", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants something local", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t025-029", "text": "Hadiza rang about Sunil's thing on Saturday. Starts at 7, bring a dish, I'm doing the jollof. Their daughter turns 5 the week after, on 31 October, party at soft play at 10am followed by cake back at theirs. She's mad about unicorns and anything glittery, Hadiza says please no more slime kits. Hadiza's own mum is visiting from Kano for a month from the 25th, first time she'll see the house.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "thing", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 5", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party at soft play", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "10am", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "unicorns", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "anything glittery", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "no more slime kits", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Kano", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month from the 25th", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t025-030", "text": "Uncle Paolo's 70th dinner, Saturday 28 November 2026 at 6pm, the Royal Hotel. Mum wants us there by half 5. He's into fishing and old westerns. I'm sorting the cake with Rosa.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 28 November 2026 at 6pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by half 5", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fishing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old westerns", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t025-032", "text": "Claire's had her baby! a girl, born Tuesday 13 October 2026 at 4:12am. C-section, she's sore but okay. Her partner Dafydd is on paternity leave for two weeks. Want to drop round a lasagne next week, text first.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday 13 October 2026 at 4:12am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sore", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round a lasagne", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "first", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t025-034", "text": "Freya didn't get the hospital job, they went with an internal candidate. She's okay about it, said she'd half expected it. Biscuit's teeth went fine though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hospital job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "teeth", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t025-035", "text": "Elijah's housewarming has moved from the 31st to Sunday 8 November at 2pm, Eli says more of a lunch thing. Aaliyah's doing a barbecue if the weather holds. Should bring something veggie for Aaliyah's brother Sunil, he's veggie.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 31st"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to Sunday 8 November at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring something veggie for Aaliyah's brother Sunil", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p5", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "veggie", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p5"}]}
{"id": "t025-037", "text": "Lin rang, she's been offered a role in Singapore starting March 2027. Huge decision, her husband would have to give up his job. She's going back and forth. Asked me not to mention it at the party.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "role in Singapore", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "going back and forth", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t025-038", "text": "Chatted with Nora at the antenatal class. She's 18 weeks, feeling sick most mornings still. Omar's been brilliant apparently. They've booked a babymoon in Lisbon for half term.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "18 weeks", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sick most mornings", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "babymoon in Lisbon", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "half term", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t025-039", "text": "Leon's mum is home from hospital now, recovering slowly. He's taking her to physio Tuesday and Thursday mornings. Ask him at the weekend how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovering", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "physio", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday and Thursday mornings", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t025-041", "text": "Adaeze's family lunch went ahead on the 14th, mum managed to come in the end. The baby is due any day now, maybe even this weekend. Remind me to ring her on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "any day now", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe even this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t025-042", "text": "Jada and her husband Leon are hosting a gender neutral baby shower, 23 January 2027 at 2pm. Anyone who wants can bring a book instead of a card. Giulia's helping with decorations.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leon", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gender neutral baby shower", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "23 January 2027 at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t025-043", "text": "Thabo's got an interview with DHL on Wednesday at 9:30am, warehouse ops manager. First interview in years and he's really anxious, hasn't slept properly since they called. Mandla wants me to do a mock interview with him tomorrow evening at 7, I've said yes. Thabo used to run a depot in Joburg for eight years so he knows his stuff, he just needs confidence. Don't forget to text Thabo good luck Tuesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with DHL", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 9:30am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since they called"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening at 7", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "used to run a depot in Joburg for eight years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Thabo good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t025-044", "text": "Anders didn't get the team lead role. He's handed in his notice, last day is 18 December. He's going freelance in the new year. Seems weirdly relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team lead role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handed in his notice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 December", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t025-047", "text": "Divya's maternity leave ends in August 2027, she's not sure she's going back to the firm. The baby's sleeping better now. Meera thinks Divya should look into the job at her company.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "maternity leave ends", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure she's going back to the firm", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t025-048", "text": "Paolo's 70th was lovely. He cried at the slideshow. Rosa did a speech. Next family thing is cousin Chloe's engagement party, 16 January 2027 at 7pm, in Leeds.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "cousin Chloe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement party", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "16 January 2027 at 7pm", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t025-049", "text": "Kate texted, her sister Jada went into labour early this morning. Kate's driving up tonight. Will check in tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "labour", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow"}]}
{"id": "t025-050", "text": "Varun Usman got an offer from Monzo! Junior data engineer, starts 11 January 2027. He's celebrating Saturday night at the pub, 8pm onwards. Bring Fern if she's free.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun Usman", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer from Monzo", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Junior data engineer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11 January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday night", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "8pm onwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring Fern", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t025-051", "text": "Simone and Paolo have invited us to their son's 3rd birthday, Sunday 1 November at 3pm. Theme is dinosaurs. He's obsessed with diggers too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "3rd birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday 1 November at 3pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dinosaurs", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "diggers", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t025-053", "text": "Mandla and his wife are pregnant, just told me at the barbecue. Baby due late May 2027. Their dog Rolo is going to be very confused. Mandla's taking paternity leave in June.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "late May 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t025-054", "text": "I'm hosting Christmas this year, 25 December. Need to order the turkey by 1 December and ask everyone about dietary stuff. Rosa's vegan now.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christmas", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "25 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "order the turkey", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 1 December", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask everyone about dietary stuff", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t025-057", "text": "Claire said the baby's christening is on Sunday 3 January 2027 at 11. She wants me to be godparent! Huge honour. Need to say yes properly and ask what's expected.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday 3 January 2027 at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "say yes properly", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask what's expected", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t025-058", "text": "Freya's got another interview, this time at a private clinic, Monday the 9th at half 9. She's less nervous this time. Her partner Divya's taking her out for brunch after either way.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday the 9th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "less nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "brunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t025-059", "text": "Sunil and Hadiza's do was brilliant. Sunil gave a little speech, their little one fell asleep under the table. Hadiza's thinking of going back to uni next September, nursing degree.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little one", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hadiza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to uni", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next September", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t025-060", "text": "Nora and Omar's baby shower is 27 February 2027, 1pm, at Nora's parents' house in Harrogate. Gift hint from Nora: they still need a decent baby carrier, the Ergobaby one. Meera and Kate want to go halves with me. Omar's new job is going well so far, he's on a three month probation till March. Nora's finishing work on 5 February. Must sort the carrier money with Meera before the end of January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "27 February 2027, 1pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "need a decent baby carrier, the Ergobaby one", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "three month probation", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishing work", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 February", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort the carrier money with Meera", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p5", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p9", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of January", "anchor": "a1"}]}
